<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Nov 96 trade deficit SKK 48.82 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Nov 96 trade deficit SKK 48.82 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak trade deficit for the first 11 months of 1996 widened to 48.82 billion crowns, from a deficit of 42.52 billion crowns for the January-October period, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREIGN TRADE   Jan-Nov'96    Jan-Oct'96  Jan-Nov'95</p>
<p>  exports (SKK bln)	247.54	  224.14	234.53</p>
<p>  imports		    296.36	  266.66	237.17</p>
<p>  balance		    -48.82	  -42.52	 -2.64</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
